graph TD
    Start([Start]) --> WifiStart[Start Wifi]
    WifiStart --> InitADC[Initialize Gas ADC]
    InitADC --> ConnectToBroker[Connect to MQTT broker]
    ConnectToBroker --> WhileTrue{While True}
    WhileTrue -- False --> End([End])
    WhileTrue -- True --> ReadSensor[Read Gas Sensor]
    ReadSensor --> ComputeMovingAverage[Compute Moving Average]
    ComputeMovingAverage --> SendDataToBroker[Send data to MQTT Broker]
    SendDataToBroker --> Wait[Wait n seconds]
    Wait --> WhileTrue
